@api = https://localhost:7100
@managerToken = PASTE_MANAGER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@ownerToken = PASTE_OWNER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@requestId = PASTE_REQUEST_ID_HERE
@rowVersion = PASTE_BASE64_ROWVERSION_FROM_PREVIOUS_RESPONSE_HERE

### Development manager login (token değerini managerToken alanına kopyalayın)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "manager@crm.local", "password": "CrmDemo!2026" }

### Development admin login (token değerini adminToken alanına kopyalayın)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@crm.local", "password": "CrmDemo!2026" }

### Manager pending queue
GET {{api}}/api/approvals/manager?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=submittedDate&sortDirection=Ascending
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Manager detail
GET {{api}}/api/approvals/manager/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Manager approve — en son response içindeki rowVersion kullanılmalıdır
POST {{api}}/api/approvals/manager/{{requestId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rowVersion": "{{rowVersion}}" }

### Manager reject
POST {{api}}/api/approvals/manager/{{requestId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rowVersion": "{{rowVersion}}", "reason": "Güvenli ret gerekçesi" }

### Admin pending queue
GET {{api}}/api/approvals/admin?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=submittedDate&sortDirection=Ascending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin detail
GET {{api}}/api/approvals/admin/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin approve — manager kararı sonrasında dönen yeni rowVersion kullanılmalıdır
POST {{api}}/api/approvals/admin/{{requestId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rowVersion": "{{rowVersion}}" }

### Admin reject
POST {{api}}/api/approvals/admin/{{requestId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rowVersion": "{{rowVersion}}", "reason": "Güvenli ret gerekçesi" }

### Approval history (owner, authoritative manager veya Admin)
GET {{api}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/approval-history
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
